 "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193373353", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970660467", "personaname": "Circuit", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970660467/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 2425, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1346, "last_played": 1764382918, "avatar": "8549ec36eb727bea6c7ae565f99066852c4ce058"}, "language": "english", "review": "I bought this in a sale. Basically got the Year One pass for free. I immediately loved this game. It ran like butter on ultra with no issues. Super fun... Until...\n\nThe Trygon update. Focus needs to focus and Trybetter. Now the servers are constantly down or disconnecting, my game stutters like crazy (5800X/4080Super) and I just got kicked for a modded game with no mods.\n\nThe update April 24 fixed a lot of the issues I post above. I can recommend this game again.\n\nThis game is super fun. The single player is an excellent way to introduce the next phase (that you can play offline too if you like).\n\nThere is hours of content and fun in this game. Worth the money to me. Worth sticking with to learn the classes.", "timestamp_created": 1745364439, "timestamp_updated": 1745582878, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193371283", "author": {"steamid": "76561199223898727", "personaname": "TheFunkly", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199223898727/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 4879, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 159, "playtime_at_review": 4